  "method": [
    "Mix the dough as listed, following each ingredient's note (late additions, salt timing). Let it ferment 75–90 min.",
    "Pre-knead 50 pieces of dough of 420 g lightly round, then work lightly longish. With seam down place on trays dusted with a mix of 75 % all-purpose and 25 % whole-wheat flour and let ferment well.",
